    <item>
      <title>EU State aid rules enable social support and investments, new Commission guidance shows</title>
      <link>https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/detail/en/ip_26_1688</link>
      <description>European Commission Press release Brussels, 27 Jul 2026 New guidance from the European Commission shows how State aid rules allow EU Member States to provide social support and social investment. This guidance assists Member States in designing State aid measures for social support and social investment, as set out in the Clean Industrial Deal.</description>
